From: Tono Team
Subject: [PATCH] fix-rpath: preserve imported application and BSP payloads

The private Qt runtime and vendor BSP are imported after native target
finalization. A cached rebuild must not rewrite their verified bytes before
the post-build hook validates and atomically replaces the previous payload.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Avaota A1 application compatibility runtime]

--- a/support/scripts/fix-rpath
+++ b/support/scripts/fix-rpath
@@ -61 +61 @@
-TARGET_EXCLUDEPATHS="/lib/firmware"
+TARGET_EXCLUDEPATHS="/lib/firmware /usr/lib/firmware /opt/tono-runtime /usr/lib/modules"
